Package: hvtiRtables
Title: Manuscript-Compliant Table Construction for HVTI CORR Group
Version: 0.9.5
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Ehrlinger", , "ehrlinj@ccf.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns 'gtsummary' table objects into MS Word tables complying
    with HVTI CORR's "Table Construction for Manuscripts" rules: flat
    (non-merged) headers, no hidden spacer columns, footnotes and
    abbreviation keys as text below the table, house font and rounding
    conventions. A JTCVS submission mode is also available, with merged
    spanning headers and lettered cell-targeted footnotes matching that
    journal's own template.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRtables, https://ehrlinger.github.io/hvtiRtables/
BugReports: https://github.com/ehrlinger/hvtiRtables/issues
